    "text": "Let $(x+10)^{50}+(x-10)^{50}=\\mathrm{a}_{0}+\\mathrm{a}_{1} x+\\mathrm{a}_{2} x^{2}+\\ldots .+\\mathrm{a}_{50} x^{50}$,\r\n\r\nfor all $x \\in \\mathbf{R} ;$ then $\\frac{\\mathrm{a}_{2}}{\\mathrm{a}_{0}}$ is equal to :",
